        "non_goals": [
          "Provide clocks, timers, cron, scheduling, natural-language parsing, opening hours, or a global holiday database.",
          "Provide general temporal-set algebra or hide timezone gap and fold policy.",
          "Own application holiday datasets, PostgreSQL connections, or process-global state."
